        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5403294c-5390-46ba-a246-4bb6108253c0).Image",
        "Description": "This couldn&apos;t have happened.\rThere was only one Phinas Whitmer, yet he was murdered by himself, and not by suicide. Or maybe he wasn&apos;t murdered at all, because it wasn&apos;t recorded? Maybe it was his future self killing his past self? Or a past self dealing with mistakes that are yet to happen?  Maybe it is a dream? An imagination? But whose?  Czeska sauna? A fairy tale plot? Or maybe there was no Phinas Whitmer at all?\rFor someone to discover the truth, someone else must create it.\rYou. Maybe him?",
